# An action vtium does not know.
# References: ADR-1100 D14.
# spec: kitty graphics protocol (sw.kovidgoyal.net/kitty/graphics-protocol, read 2026-11-13), "Querying support for protocol features": "If e is missing from the reply, the action is not supported, and no other keys are reported."
# covers: image.kitty
size 20 10
send "\e_Ga=q,i=43,e=Z,U=1\e\\"
